lab=a.add('sections',9,'Paper source audit: treat the supplied passages as the complete classroom source set, not a live catalogue. For each of the six claims mark citation present, whether its ID resolves, and whether that cited passage supports the exact claim. Label the shelf5 assertion conflicting with R; universal suitability unverified; Z missing. The uncited OM-2 claim is supported elsewhere in the supplied set but not by a cited passage, so it does not count as cited support under this rubric. Compute the three rates and propose repairs without changing edition IDs or averaging page counts. Distinguish link-resolution failure, contradiction and lack of support. Extra copies of R are not independent sources. No award result, price or real-world catalogue truth is supplied. Keep the independent five-claim task for a first attempt before feedback.')
